Raw README.md (Copy & Paste)Markdown# Nautilus DevOps — LocalStack Streaming & Storage Infrastructure

Terraform configuration for provisioning streaming and storage resources on LocalStack for the Nautilus DevOps team.

## Resources & Configuration

| Component | Name / Value | Details |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Kinesis Stream** | `datacenter-dev-stream` | 1 shard, 24-hour retention period, tagged `Environment = dev` & `Purpose = Stream ingestion` |
| **S3 Bucket** | `datacenter-dev-67458725` | Tagged `Environment = dev` & `Owner = datacenter` |
| **STS Caller Identity** | `000000000000` | Queried via `aws_caller_identity` and logged via `null_resource` |

## Project Structure (`/home/bob/terraform`)

* `main.tf` — Kinesis stream, S3 bucket, STS caller identity lookup, and `local-exec` log provisioners
* `variables.tf` — Input variable definitions (`KKE_ENVIRONMENT`, `KKE_KINESIS_STREAM_NAME`, `KKE_S3_BUCKET_NAME`)
* `terraform.tfvars` — Variable values for the `dev` environment
* `outputs.tf` — Exports `kke_caller_identity_account_id`, `kke_kinesis_stream_name`, and `kke_s3_bucket_name`
* `kinesis_creation.log` — Records `"Kinesis Stream datacenter-dev-stream created"`
* `s3_creation.log` — Records `"S3 Bucket datacenter-dev-67458725 created"`
* `account_identity.log` — Records `"Logged in as account ID:000000000000"`

## Usage

```bash
cd /home/bob/terraform
terraform init
terraform apply -auto-approve
terraform plan

